        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Rental operations are fully aligned with our dealership strategy, as the rent-to-sell solution provides an additional sales channel through which we are able to populate our territories with equipment and generate high-margin parts and service revenues thereafter.",
        "start_character": 10867,
        "end_character": 11131
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076932",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076932-7fa8473b310608d6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our branch network, we sell, rent, and provide parts and service support for several categories of specialized equipment, including lift trucks and other material handling equipment, heavy and compact earthmoving equipment, crushing and screening equipment, environmental processing equipment, cranes and aerial work platforms, paving and asphalt equipment, other construction equipment, and allied products.",
        "start_character": 125,
        "end_character": 541
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076932",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076932-7fa8473b310608d6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell tangential products and services related to our equipment offerings which include, but are not limited to, automated equipment installation and warehouse management systems integration.",
        "start_character": 3701,
        "end_character": 3899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076932",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076932-7fa8473b310608d6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our ERP and its CRM functionality enhances our sales management capabilities by increasing the productivity of our sales teams and tracking equipment service history to advance our customer support goals.",
        "start_character": 18311,
        "end_character": 18526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076932",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076932-7fa8473b310608d6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we provide best-in-class parts and service support to our customers, and the ability to attract and retain skilled technicians is critical to aftermarket performance.",
        "start_character": 9936,
        "end_character": 10113
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-076932",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-076932-7fa8473b310608d6",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-076932",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
